# Local document storage (uploaded files — kept out of version control).
# ANCHORED DELIBERATELY. The unanchored form `storage/` matched every source
# folder named Storage — on a case-insensitive filesystem too — and silently
# kept IFileStorage.cs and LocalFileStorage.cs out of the repository entirely
# from EPIC-?? until EPIC-006 S002. A fresh clone did not build. Keep the
# leading slash; the upload root is configured as Storage:RootPath = "storage",
# relative to the API's content root.
/src/Host/RegOS.Api/storage/
